plaintext
* SPICE Netlist

IREF 4 2 DC 1mA

* NMOS Transistors
M0 4 2 0 0 NMOS
M1 8 2 9 9 NMOS
M2 9 2 3 3 NMOS
M3 10 2 11 11 NMOS
M4 6 2 5 5 NMOS
M5 4 2 6 6 NMOS

* Model definitions
.model NMOS NMOS (LEVEL=1)

* Independent voltage source for node 2 reference (ground)
V0 0 2 DC 0

* .END statement
.END